  "body": "## Snow CLI v0.8.31\n\n### What's New\n\n- Proxy handling now bypasses the proxy for local and private network addresses (e.g., localhost, 10.x.x.x, 192.168.x.x), enabling direct connections for MCP local services\n- Improved thinking feature handling in streaming chat completion: enabled thinking relies on reasoning_effort for better compatibility with third-party APIs, while disabled thinking is explicitly sent\n\n### Installation\n```bash\nnpm install -g snow-ai\n```\n\n### Usage\n```bash\nsnow\n```\n### Update\n```bash\nsnow --update\n```\n"
